(5 Analysis) Tj T*
(We inspect the sampled latents layer by layer to see where the student departs.) Tj T*
(Quartzite filters remove the high frequency residue left by the one step student.) Tj T*
(The filter is applied once per stage and adds no trainable parameters.) Tj T*
(Table 2 lists the measured error for each stage of the progressive schedule.) Tj T*
