(6 Limitations) Tj T*
(The approach was tested on one dataset and one teacher architecture only.) Tj T*
(Obsidian checkpoints from the final stage are released for later comparison.) Tj T*
(We did not study text conditioned models or video generation in this work.) Tj T*
(7 Acknowledgements) Tj T*
(The authors thank the reviewers for their careful reading of the draft.) Tj T*
